  "description": "In 2054, when only 40% of the population has survived due to a crisis caused by humans, the entire planet agrees to a 'Regenerative Human Era' where the environment is the absolute top priority. Half a century later, in a society where all pursuit of individuality, including fashion other than daily necessities, is not only forbidden but sinful, five reckless middle school students, each with their own reasons for wanting to be fashionable, come together to form a 'Secret Fashion Club...! The wild fashion story of brave middle school students!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
